{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MyReceipts 是一款專為快速捕捉與管理收支憑證而設的應用程式，適合需要處理商務報銷或個人記帳的用戶。現在 App Store 提供限時免費下載機會，讓用戶以零成本享有原價 US $0.99 的智能掃描服務，輕鬆將紙本收據轉化為數位記錄。</p>\n\n<h2>AI 自動辨識與資料擷取</h2>\n<p>透過裝置端的人工智能技術，此應用能自動偵測商戶名稱、日期及總金額等關鍵資訊並預填欄位，大幅減少手動輸入時間。用戶可透過相機掃描或從相簿匯入圖片，亦支援無限次掃描、保存原始影像備註、一鍵匯出 CSV 檔案以及生成包含詳情與圖文的專業 PDF 報告，協助高效整理所有開支紀錄。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-11-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-18-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-12-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MyReceipts</li>\n<li>應用類別：Business</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T21:39:31.570990+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}